From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonathan Goyvaerts <jonathan.goyvaerts@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 14:19:23 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] usb: dwc3: export the register access tracepoints

dwc3_readl() and dwc3_writel() are inline in io.h and fire the
dwc3_readl/dwc3_writel tracepoints. dwc3-apple uses them for the T6040
USB3 PIPE reset, so with CONFIG_TRACING a modular dwc3-apple fails
modpost:

  ERROR: modpost: "__tracepoint_dwc3_readl" [drivers/usb/dwc3/dwc3-apple.ko] undefined!

Export both tracepoints from the core.

Signed-off-by: Jonathan Goyvaerts <jonathan.goyvaerts@gmail.com>
Assisted-by: LLM

[j604 backport: prerequisite of 42b59c92c0, whose glue code calls dwc3_readl()/dwc3_writel() from the modular dwc3-apple (CONFIG_USB_DWC3_APPLE=m and CONFIG_TRACING in the recipe config). Aurora carries it as a8a5ad726e. The object was not in the local shallow clone, so this was applied with git am from the published patch (github.com/aurora-silicon/linux commit c506653127a7.patch); same diff, same author and date.]
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5

---
 drivers/usb/dwc3/trace.c | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/usb/dwc3/trace.c b/drivers/usb/dwc3/trace.c
index 0889958856..02bea9ed0f 100644
--- a/drivers/usb/dwc3/trace.c
+++ b/drivers/usb/dwc3/trace.c
@@ -9,3 +9,7 @@
 
 #define CREATE_TRACE_POINTS
 #include "trace.h"
+
+/* io.h accessors are inline; glue modules that use them (dwc3-apple) need these. */
+EXPORT_TRACEPOINT_SYMBOL_GPL(dwc3_readl);
+EXPORT_TRACEPOINT_SYMBOL_GPL(dwc3_writel);
